    "asOf": "2025-03-14",
    "date": "2026-09-24T15:03:30Z",
    "text": "Human-Animal Chimera Prohibition Act of 2025\n\nThis bill establishes new federal crimes related to conduct involving certain types of human-animal chimeras. The term human-animal chimera means an organism that, from an early stage of development, contains human and nonhuman parts.\n\nThis bill makes it unlawful to\n\ncreate or attempt to create a prohibited human-animal chimera,transfer or attempt to transfer a human embryo into a nonhuman womb,transfer or attempt to transfer a nonhuman embryo into a human womb, ortransport or receive for any purpose a prohibited human-animal chimera.A violator is subject to civil and criminal penalties."
  },
